Z||000011||Oreif||12-21-2000||02:28 PM||||The "SD4" version is the same as an Indy scoop, Just sold by a different place. They call the IMSA body the SD4 body. (The IMSA racecars used the SD4 engines.)<BR>See the link in my previous post above and pic below.<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/Fiero170.gif"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 12-21-2000).]||||reg||1
